class:: Vpulse
summary:: Pbind that produces expanding-pulse visual events
categories:: Libraries>VisualServer
related:: Classes/Vbind, Classes/VisualSynthDef, Guides/VisualServer, Reference/VisualParameters

description::

Factory returning a link::Classes/Pbind:: pre-seeded with code::(type: \vpulse, dur: 1, view: \default)::. Targets the code::\pulse:: link::Classes/VisualSynthDef::, which sweeps size from code::\startSize:: to code::\endSize:: over the node lifetime. See link::Classes/Vbind:: for the shared playback model and link::Reference/VisualParameters:: for keys.

CLASSMETHODS::

method:: new
argument:: ... pairs
Pbind-style pairs. Common keys: code::x y startSize endSize color dur curve view:: plus the envelope keys.
returns:: a link::Classes/Pbind::.

EXAMPLES::

code::
Vpulse(
    \x, Pwhite(-0.5, 0.5), \y, Pwhite(-0.5, 0.5),
    \startSize, 5, \endSize, Pexprand(80, 200),
    \color, Pfunc({ Color.hsv(0.6, 0.8, 0.9) }),
    \dur, 0.8, \view, \demo
).vplay;
::
